;Authors state that the chain B is a hybrid sequence which corresponds approximately to sequence 609-623 of eIF4E (Q04637).
The actual sequence is: Ac-KKRYSREQLL(S5)FQR(S5)-NH2  
S5 corresponds to (S)-2-(4-pentenyl) alanine.  This are linked together via RCM(ring closing metathesis) to form a hydrocarbon staples.
